Redistributed from the original jar under the same licence:

  * every texture under assets/enhancedvisuals/textures/gui/ev/, which is
    assets/enhancedvisuals/visuals/{particle,overlay}/composited into rotation grids
    (see tools/gen_assets.py); the overlays are downscaled to 256x256,
  * assets/enhancedvisuals/sounds/*.ogg and assets/enhancedvisuals/sounds.json, unchanged,
  * icon.png, the original's mod icon.

The Rust code in src/ and the port's behaviour notes are part of this port.
